AHB.audio({"groups": {"part-01-vocabulary": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-01-vocabulary/001.mp3", "text": "Fadi receives an (1)… from NorthBridge."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-01-vocabulary/002.mp3", "text": "He checks the (2)…: the product, the quantity, the price, and the (3)… number."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-01-vocabulary/003.mp3", "text": "He makes sure everything is (4)"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-01-vocabulary/004.mp3", "text": "Then he writes to (5)… the order for the (6)"}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-02-grammar": [{"clips": [{"ar": "نستخدم المضارع البسيط لوصف عملية، أي ما نفعله دائماً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/001.mp3", "text": "We use the PRESENT SIMPLE to describe a PROCESS — what we always do."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/002.mp3", "text": "We receive the order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/003.mp3", "text": "We check the details."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/004.mp3", "text": "We confirm it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/005.mp3", "text": "For he/she/it, add -s: The system sends a reply."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/006.mp3", "text": "The customer places an order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/007.mp3", "text": "This is the same present simple you know."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/008.mp3", "text": "We use it to describe how the work always happens."}, {"ar": "لنقول الخطوات بالترتيب نستخدم كلمات الترتيب: أولاً، ثم، بعد ذلك، وأخيراً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/009.mp3", "text": "To say the steps IN ORDER, we use SEQUENCE WORDS: first, then, next, after that, finally."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/010.mp3", "text": "First, we receive the order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/011.mp3", "text": "Then we check the details."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/012.mp3", "text": "Next, we correct any mistakes."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/013.mp3", "text": "Finally, we confirm it."}, {"ar": "هذه الكلمات توضّح ترتيب الخطوات.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/014.mp3", "text": "These words make the order of the steps clear."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/015.mp3", "text": "To give an INSTRUCTION or a command, we use the IMPERATIVE — the base verb, with no subject: Check the details."}, {"ar": "أكّد الطلب.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/016.mp3", "text": "Confirm the order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/017.mp3", "text": "Send the email."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/018.mp3", "text": "To make it negative (don't do this): Don't forget the reference number."}, {"ar": "وللتهذيب نضيف من فضلك. من فضلك تحقّق من الكمية.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/019.mp3", "text": "To be polite, add 'please': Please check the quantity."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/020.mp3", "text": "The imperative has no subject and no -s: 'Check the details' (NOT 'You checks' or 'To check')."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/021.mp3", "text": "And remember the present simple -s for he/she/it: 'Fadi checks the order' (NOT 'Fadi check')."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/022.mp3", "text": "Use sequence words to make steps clear: First… Then… Finally"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-02-grammar/023.mp3", "text": "Present simple: we check / he checks Sequence: first, then, next, after that, finally Imperative: Check! · Don't forget! · Please check."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-03-listening": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/001.mp3", "text": "Listen and read. (Your teacher will read the dialogue, or play the audio.)"}], "title": "Read and listen"}, {"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/002.mp3", "text": "Hello, Fadi. I'd like to place an order. 1,000 tonnes of cement."}, {"ar": "شكراً يا سيدة تشِن. أرجو أن ترسلي لي أمر الشراء.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/003.mp3", "text": "Thank you, Ms. Chen. Please send me the purchase order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/004.mp3", "text": "I sent it this morning. The reference is PO-1234."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/005.mp3", "text": "Let me check. First, I read the PO. Then I check the details. The product is cement — correct. The quantity is 1,000 tonnes — correct."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/006.mp3", "text": "Good."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/007.mp3", "text": "But there is a small mistake. The correct reference number is PO-1243, not PO-1234."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/008.mp3", "text": "Oh! You are right. Please correct it to PO-1243."}, {"ar": "بالطبع. الآن التفاصيل صحيحة. سأؤكّد طلبك وأرسل رسالة تأكيد.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/009.mp3", "text": "Of course. Now the details are correct. I will confirm your order and send a confirmation email."}, {"ar": "شكراً يا فادي. أنت دقيق جداً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/010.mp3", "text": "Thank you, Fadi. You are very careful."}], "title": "Dialogue D1"}, {"clips": [{"ar": "يا فادي، أرجو أن تتحقق من الرقم المرجعي في هذا الطلب.", "speaker": "Karim", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/011.mp3", "text": "Fadi, please check the reference number on this order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/012.mp3", "text": "OK. The PO says PO-1234. But our number is PO-1243."}, {"ar": "إذاً هو خاطئ. ماذا تفعل الآن؟", "speaker": "Karim", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/013.mp3", "text": "So it's wrong. What do you do now?"}, {"ar": "أولاً أكتب إلى العميل. ثم أطلب منه تصحيحه. وبعد ذلك أؤكّد الطلب.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/014.mp3", "text": "First, I write to the customer. Then I ask them to correct it. After that, I confirm the order."}, {"ar": "جيد. لا تؤكّد طلباً برقم خاطئ.", "speaker": "Karim", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/015.mp3", "text": "Good. Don't confirm an order with a wrong number."}, {"ar": "بالطبع لا. أتحقق دائماً أولاً، ثم أؤكّد.", "speaker": "Fadi", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/016.mp3", "text": "Of course not. I always check first, then confirm."}, {"ar": "ممتاز. هذه هي الطريقة الصحيحة.", "speaker": "Karim", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-03-listening/017.mp3", "text": "Perfect. That's the right way."}], "title": "Dialogue D2"}], "part-04-speaking": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-04-speaking/001.mp3", "text": "A: Place an order ('I'd like to order…')."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-04-speaking/002.mp3", "text": "B: Ask for the PO ('Please send the purchase order')."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-04-speaking/003.mp3", "text": "B: Check the details ('First I read… Then I check…')."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-04-speaking/004.mp3", "text": "A: Correct a detail."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-04-speaking/005.mp3", "text": "B confirms the order."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-05-reading": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/001.mp3", "text": "In business, small things are not small."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/002.mp3", "text": "A single wrong number in an order can become a very big problem."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/003.mp3", "text": "Imagine this."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/004.mp3", "text": "A customer orders 1,000 tonnes of cement."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/005.mp3", "text": "But someone writes '100' instead of '1,000'."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/006.mp3", "text": "Now the company sends 100 tonnes — one tenth of the order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/007.mp3", "text": "The customer's building stops, because there is not enough cement."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/008.mp3", "text": "The customer is angry."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/009.mp3", "text": "And it all started with one missing zero."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/010.mp3", "text": "This is why checking is so important."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/011.mp3", "text": "Checking is not exciting work."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/012.mp3", "text": "Nobody feels like a hero when they read an order carefully and find a small mistake."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/013.mp3", "text": "But that quiet, careful work saves the company from big problems."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/014.mp3", "text": "One person checks every detail: the product, the quantity, the price, the address, and the reference number."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/015.mp3", "text": "This is some of the most valuable work in the company."}, {"ar": "المدقّق الجيد يساوي وزنه ذهباً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/016.mp3", "text": "A good 'checker' is worth their weight in gold."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/017.mp3", "text": "How do you check well?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/018.mp3", "text": "The secret is simple: go slowly, and check one thing at a time."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/019.mp3", "text": "First, the product: is it correct?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/020.mp3", "text": "Then the quantity: is the number right — and are all the zeros there?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/021.mp3", "text": "Next, the price."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/022.mp3", "text": "Then the customer's name and address."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/023.mp3", "text": "Then the reference number."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/024.mp3", "text": "Don't check five things at once."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/025.mp3", "text": "Check one thing, tick it, then the next."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/026.mp3", "text": "And when you find a mistake — even a tiny one — don't ignore it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/027.mp3", "text": "Stop, and correct it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/028.mp3", "text": "A small mistake, corrected now, is easy."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/029.mp3", "text": "The same mistake, found after delivery, is a disaster."}, {"ar": "هناك عادة جيدة تتبعها أفضل الشركات: أكّد دائماً كتابةً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/030.mp3", "text": "There is a good habit that the best companies use: always confirm in writing."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/031.mp3", "text": "After you check the order, you write a confirmation: 'We confirm your order: cement, 1,000 tonnes, reference PO-1243.'"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/032.mp3", "text": "Because now both sides can see the details, in writing."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/033.mp3", "text": "If there is a mistake, the customer sees it and says, 'No, that's wrong.'"}, {"ar": "التأكيد المكتوب كالمرآة. يُظهر للطرفين كل التفاصيل.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/034.mp3", "text": "The written confirmation is like a mirror — it shows both sides all the details."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/035.mp3", "text": "So check carefully, correct any mistake, and confirm in writing."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/036.mp3", "text": "Do these three simple things, every time, and your orders will be right — and your partners will trust you."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/037.mp3", "text": "A small (1)… in an order can become a big problem."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/038.mp3", "text": "So (2)… is very important."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/039.mp3", "text": "Go (3)…, and check one thing at a time."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/040.mp3", "text": "When you find a mistake, (4)… it — don't ignore it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-05-reading/041.mp3", "text": "And always (5)… in writing, so both sides can see the (6)"}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-06-writing": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-06-writing/001.mp3", "text": "Sentence starters: “Thank you for your order.” · “We confirm: …” · “Reference: …” · “Your order is approved.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-06-writing/002.mp3", "text": "I confirmed the product, quantity and total."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-07-trade-skills": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/001.mp3", "text": "The purchase order, or PO, is one of the most important documents in trade."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/002.mp3", "text": "It is the document that says 'I want to buy'."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/003.mp3", "text": "When a PO arrives, your job is to read it, check it, and confirm it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/004.mp3", "text": "A PO has clear parts, and you must check every one."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/005.mp3", "text": "The REFERENCE NUMBER names the order — like PO-1243."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/006.mp3", "text": "This number is very important, because you use it in every email and document about this order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/007.mp3", "text": "The CUSTOMER is the company who buys."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/008.mp3", "text": "The PRODUCT, the QUANTITY, and the PRICE are the order itself — check that they match the quotation."}, {"ar": "والمجموع هو الرقم النهائي. تحقّق من الحساب.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/009.mp3", "text": "And the TOTAL is the final number — check the maths."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/010.mp3", "text": "When you check a PO, use the reference number in your reply, so both sides talk about the same order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/011.mp3", "text": "'Thank you for order PO-1243."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/012.mp3", "text": "We confirm…' This small habit — always naming the reference number — stops a lot of confusion."}, {"ar": "في شركة مزدحمة بطلبات كثيرة، الرقم المرجعي هو ما يبقي كل طلب منفصلاً وواضحاً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/013.mp3", "text": "In a busy company with many orders, the reference number is how you keep every order separate and clear."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-07-trade-skills/014.mp3", "text": "Learn to read a PO carefully, and you will never lose an order."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-08-consolidation": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/001.mp3", "text": "A new order arrives."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/002.mp3", "text": "It is a big one — 5,000 tonnes of cement, for a new customer."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/003.mp3", "text": "Fadi is excited, but he does not hurry."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/004.mp3", "text": "He checks the order slowly, one detail at a time."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/005.mp3", "text": "First, the product: cement — correct."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/006.mp3", "text": "Then the quantity: 5,000 tonnes — correct."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/007.mp3", "text": "Then the price."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/008.mp3", "text": "Then the customer's name and address."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/009.mp3", "text": "Then Fadi checks the address again."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/010.mp3", "text": "Something is wrong."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/011.mp3", "text": "The city is right, but the street number is 'Street 5', and Fadi remembers the customer is on 'Street 15'."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/012.mp3", "text": "A small thing — one missing '1'."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/013.mp3", "text": "But Fadi knows: a wrong address means the delivery goes to the wrong place."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/014.mp3", "text": "So he stops, and he writes to the customer: 'Dear Sir, please can you check the delivery address?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/015.mp3", "text": "Is it Street 5 or Street 15?'"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/016.mp3", "text": "The customer replies: 'You are right — it is Street 15."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/017.mp3", "text": "Thank you for checking!'"}, {"ar": "يصحّح فادي العنوان ويؤكّد الطلب.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/018.mp3", "text": "Fadi corrects the address and confirms the order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/019.mp3", "text": "Later, Karim hears the story."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/020.mp3", "text": "“Well done, Fadi,” he says."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/021.mp3", "text": "“A wrong address on a 5,000-tonne order — that is a big, expensive mistake."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/022.mp3", "text": "And you found it, because you checked slowly and carefully."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/023.mp3", "text": "You are not just an assistant."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/024.mp3", "text": "You are the person who protects every order.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/025.mp3", "text": "Fadi smiles."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/026.mp3", "text": "“I only checked an address,” he thinks."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/027.mp3", "text": "“A small thing."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/028.mp3", "text": "But small, careful checks stop big, expensive mistakes."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-08-consolidation/029.mp3", "text": "That is the quiet, important work — and I am proud to do it well.”"}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-09-cases": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-09-cases/001.mp3", "text": "A purchase order says '100 tonnes'."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-09-cases/002.mp3", "text": "But the customer asked for 1,000 tonnes in the enquiry."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-09-cases/003.mp3", "text": "There is a missing zero."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-09-cases/004.mp3", "text": "Write one polite sentence to check the quantity with the customer."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-09-cases/005.mp3", "text": "A colleague is busy."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-09-cases/006.mp3", "text": "A PO arrives, and he confirms it in ten seconds, without checking the details."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-09-cases/007.mp3", "text": "Later, the price is wrong."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-09-cases/008.mp3", "text": "You write an email about an order, but you forget the reference number."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-09-cases/009.mp3", "text": "Your company has 50 orders this week."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-09-cases/010.mp3", "text": "The customer does not know which order you mean."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-10-review": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-10-review/001.mp3", "text": "First, we receive the purchase order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-10-review/002.mp3", "text": "Then we check the details — the product, the quantity, the price, and the reference number."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-10-review/003.mp3", "text": "Next, we correct any mistake."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-10-review/004.mp3", "text": "Finally, we confirm the order and send a confirmation email."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-10-review/005.mp3", "text": "Every order, the same way."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-10-review/006.mp3", "text": "[Teacher reads] 'Thank you for your order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-10-review/007.mp3", "text": "We confirm: cement, 1,000 tonnes, total 45,000 dollars."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-10-review/008.mp3", "text": "The reference is PO-1243."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-10-review/009.mp3", "text": "Your order is approved.'"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-10-review/010.mp3", "text": "I can give simple instructions (first, then…)."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-10-review/011.mp3", "text": "I can write an order-confirmation email."}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "part-11-foundations": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/001.mp3", "text": "This unit is about orders and documents."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/002.mp3", "text": "But hidden inside it is one of the most important qualities in all work: CARE."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/003.mp3", "text": "Care is the quiet habit of doing small things properly."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/004.mp3", "text": "It is not exciting."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/005.mp3", "text": "It does not look impressive."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/006.mp3", "text": "But it is, quietly, one of the most valuable things a person can bring to any job."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/007.mp3", "text": "Think about the two kinds of workers."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/008.mp3", "text": "The first is fast but careless."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/009.mp3", "text": "They finish quickly, but they make small mistakes — a wrong number here, a missing detail there."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/010.mp3", "text": "Their work looks fast, but it creates problems for everyone else, and the problems cost time and money to fix."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/011.mp3", "text": "The second worker is careful."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/012.mp3", "text": "They go a little slower, but they check their work, they catch small mistakes, and what they produce is correct."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/013.mp3", "text": "Who is really faster?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/014.mp3", "text": "The careful one — because nobody does the work twice."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/015.mp3", "text": "This is a deep truth that many people learn too late: careful is faster than careless, in the end."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/016.mp3", "text": "A mistake caught now takes one minute to fix."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/017.mp3", "text": "But if you find the same mistake later, it takes days to fix, and it costs a lot."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/018.mp3", "text": "So the careful worker, who seems slower, is actually saving huge amounts of time and money."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/019.mp3", "text": "And they build something even more valuable: trust."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/020.mp3", "text": "When people know that your work is always correct, they stop checking it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/021.mp3", "text": "They give you bigger, more important jobs."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/022.mp3", "text": "Care is how a junior becomes a manager."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/023.mp3", "text": "So whatever your job, bring care to it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/024.mp3", "text": "Check your work before you send it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/025.mp3", "text": "Read the number twice."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/026.mp3", "text": "Correct the small mistake now, not later."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/027.mp3", "text": "Do the quiet, careful thing, every time."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/028.mp3", "text": "People will not always notice it — but it will always matter."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/029.mp3", "text": "And slowly, quietly, it will make you the person that everyone trusts."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/030.mp3", "text": "People will give the good jobs to you."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/031.mp3", "text": "In a world of fast and careless, be careful."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/032.mp3", "text": "It is a quiet superpower — and it is a choice you can make, in every small task, starting today."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/033.mp3", "text": "Think of a time a small mistake (yours or someone's) caused a big problem."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/034.mp3", "text": "What was the mistake?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/035.mp3", "text": "How could a careful check stop it?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/036.mp3", "text": "Tell your partner."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/037.mp3", "text": "Write the steps of a job you do (30–50 words), using 'First…, Then…, Next…, Finally…' and at least one imperative."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/part-11-foundations/038.mp3", "text": "Study terms: order / purchase order (PO) / confirmation | reference number / customer / details | present simple (the process) | sequence words (first, then, finally) | imperatives (Check! · Don't forget!) | care · accuracy · attention to detail"}], "title": "Read and listen"}], "warm-up": [{"clips": [{"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/001.mp3", "text": "Look at the pictures."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/002.mp3", "text": "Answer these questions before you read."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/003.mp3", "text": "Ms. Chen likes the quotation."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/004.mp3", "text": "Now she places an ORDER."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/005.mp3", "text": "She sends a document called a PURCHASE ORDER, or 'PO' for short."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/006.mp3", "text": "A purchase order says: 'I want to buy this."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/007.mp3", "text": "This is the quantity."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/008.mp3", "text": "This is the price."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/009.mp3", "text": "This is my company.'"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/010.mp3", "text": "Fadi, the Administrative Assistant, receives the purchase order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/011.mp3", "text": "His job is to check it, confirm it, and record it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/012.mp3", "text": "This is important work."}, {"ar": "للطلب تفاصيل كثيرة: المنتج والكمية والسعر واسم العميل والرقم المرجعي.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/013.mp3", "text": "An order has many details — the product, the quantity, the price, the customer's name, and the reference number."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/014.mp3", "text": "If one detail is wrong, there is a problem."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/015.mp3", "text": "So Fadi checks every detail carefully."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/016.mp3", "text": "“Let me check the order,” says Fadi."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/017.mp3", "text": "“First, I read the purchase order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/018.mp3", "text": "Then I check the details."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/019.mp3", "text": "The product is cement — correct."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/020.mp3", "text": "The quantity is 1,000 tonnes — correct."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/021.mp3", "text": "The price is 45 dollars per tonne — correct.”"}, {"ar": "لكن بعد ذلك يرى فادي خطأً صغيراً.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/022.mp3", "text": "But then Fadi sees a small mistake."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/023.mp3", "text": "“Wait,” he says."}, {"ar": "الرقم المرجعي خاطئ.", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/024.mp3", "text": "“The reference number is wrong."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/025.mp3", "text": "The PO says PO-1234, but our number is PO-1243.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/026.mp3", "text": "Fadi does not ignore the mistake."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/027.mp3", "text": "He writes to Ms. Chen: “Dear Ms. Chen, thank you for your order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/028.mp3", "text": "There is a small mistake in the reference number."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/029.mp3", "text": "Please can you check it?"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/030.mp3", "text": "Best, Fadi.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/031.mp3", "text": "Ms. Chen replies quickly and corrects it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/032.mp3", "text": "Now the order is correct."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/033.mp3", "text": "Fadi confirms it."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/034.mp3", "text": "He writes an order-confirmation email: “Dear Ms. Chen, thank you for your order."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/035.mp3", "text": "We confirm: cement, 1,000 tonnes, 45 dollars per tonne, total 45,000 dollars."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/036.mp3", "text": "Reference: PO-1243."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/037.mp3", "text": "Your order is approved."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/038.mp3", "text": "Best regards, Fadi.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/039.mp3", "text": "“A good confirmation,” says Karim."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/040.mp3", "text": "“Now Ms. Chen knows we have her order, and that all the details are correct."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/041.mp3", "text": "This is how we work: receive, check, confirm."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/042.mp3", "text": "Every order, the same way."}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/043.mp3", "text": "When you check carefully and confirm clearly, there are no problems later.”"}, {"ar": "", "speaker": "Ms. Chen", "src": "../../assets/audio/unit-05/warm-up/044.mp3", "text": "And so, we place the order, check it, and confirm it — a big step towards the delivery."}], "title": "Read and listen"}]}, "unit": 5});
